{
    "title": "Weather Radar & Weather Live",
    "description": "Welcome to <b>Weather Radar & Weather Live</b>, your trusted companion on all things weather! If you have important plans, want to predict changes in nature or get the fastest live weather updates, NOAA weather radar, weather maps and local weather forecasts, you can't miss our \"Weather Radar & Live Weather\" app. This is a great weather forecast application that provides <b>live weather</b> and accurate information, weather radar and weather updates for all localities in the world. You can view weather maps, live earthquake map, live radar, storm radar, rain tracker, get bad weather alerts, check air quality index, UV index and much more through <b>live weather radar</b> of NOAA. Stay connected with the free weather radar app.\r\n\r\nWith <b>Weather Radar & Weather Live</b>, you can view the current and future locations of hurricanes and other bad weather. You can also grant access to receive weather radar maps notifications, storm radar, rain tracker, live weather, local weather forecasts, tropical storms, winter storms, and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49<b>Special features</b>\r\n- Accurate weather radar maps, live weather, local weather.\r\n- Automatically detect location via GPS and network: Quickly know today's weather at my location.\r\n- Satellite weather map with high resolution.\r\n- Global weather radar: You can search, manage and monitor live weather in multiple locations.\r\n- More weather radar overlays: Provides live weather information on cloud cover, etc.\r\n- Real-time weather radar, live earthquake map.\r\nGo pro with Weather Radar: NOAA LIVE WEATHER RADAR\r\n- Monitor local weather radar and live radar.\r\n- Track hurricanes, live earthquake map and tropical storms, gulf hurricane tracker.\r\n- Temperature forecast, air quality, barometric pressure.\r\n- Rain tracking, rainy day warnings, snow report.\r\n- Live monitoring of fires and hot spots.\r\n- Wind speed, predict wind, wind compass, wind direction.\r\n- Cloud cover and UV index.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0d<b>Live weather forecast</b>\r\n- Hourly and daily live weather forecast.\r\n- Weather forecast for all countries and cities: United States, France, Germany, United Kingdom (UK), Japan, Korea, London, New York, Sydney, Toronto, etc.\r\n- Add live weather information: sunrise and sunset times, humidity, rain probability, visibility, temperature, dew point, UV index, air quality, etc.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f<b>Weather widget</b>\r\n- Easily check current weather information through the live weather widget.\r\n- Weather widget can switch between different themes depending on current weather conditions.\r\n- The format and size of the weather widget are diverse, you can choose according to your preferences.\r\n\u26c8\ufe0f<b>Weather warnings and notifications</b>\r\n- Live weather notifications on the status bar with today's weather information and tomorrow's weather information help you pinpoint weather and plan your day and trip better.\r\n- Provides bad weather warnings, local weather radar forecasts: Rainy day alerts, live earthquake map, snow report, hurricane.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08Weather Radar & Weather Live is a free live weather app that provides the weather forecast information you need. Download now to experience \"Weather Radar & Weather Live\" - a weather application that fully integrates radar features.",
